{
  "sn12.36:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 12.36 ",
  "sn12.36:0.2": "4. Kaḷārakhattiyavagga ",
  "sn12.36:0.3": "Dutiyaavijjāpaccayasutta ",
  "sn12.36:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn12.36:1.2": "“Avijjāpaccayā, bhikkhave, saṅkhārā; ",
  "sn12.36:1.3": "saṅkhārapaccayā viññāṇaṁ …pe… ",
  "sn12.36:1.4": "evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti. ",
  "sn12.36:2.1": "‘Katamaṁ jarāmaraṇaṁ, kassa ca panidaṁ jarāmaraṇan’ti iti vā, bhikkhave, yo vadeyya, ‘aññaṁ jarāmaraṇaṁ, aññassa ca panidaṁ jarāmaraṇan’ti iti vā, bhikkhave, yo vadeyya, ubhayametaṁ ekatthaṁ byañjanameva nānaṁ. ",
  "sn12.36:2.2": "‘Taṁ jīvaṁ taṁ sarīraṁ’ iti vā, bhikkhave, diṭṭhiyā sati brahmacariyavāso na hoti. ",
  "sn12.36:2.3": "‘Aññaṁ jīvaṁ aññaṁ sarīraṁ’ iti vā, bhikkhave, diṭṭhiyā sati brahmacariyavāso na hoti. ",
  "sn12.36:2.4": "Ete te, bhikkhave, ubho ante anupagamma majjhena tathāgato dhammaṁ deseti: ",
  "sn12.36:2.5": "‘jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇan’ti. ",
  "sn12.36:3.1": "Katamā jāti …pe… ",
  "sn12.36:3.2": "katamo bhavo … ",
  "sn12.36:3.3": "katamaṁ upādānaṁ … ",
  "sn12.36:3.4": "katamā taṇhā … ",
  "sn12.36:3.5": "katamā vedanā … ",
  "sn12.36:3.6": "katamo phasso … ",
  "sn12.36:3.7": "katamaṁ saḷāyatanaṁ … ",
  "sn12.36:3.8": "katamaṁ nāmarūpaṁ … ",
  "sn12.36:3.9": "katamaṁ viññāṇaṁ … ",
  "sn12.36:3.10": "katame saṅkhārā, kas